<section id="complete-module-source"><h2>Complete Lean source</h2>
<details data-lean-code-panel><summary><code>AutoSamplingTheory/TechnicalLemmas/FunctionalInequalities/WeightedC1GradientDomain.lean</code> — full module with imports and context</summary>
